<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: RUGBY UNION-AUSTRALIA BEAT IRELAND 22-12.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-AUSTRALIA BEAT IRELAND 22-12.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1996-11-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia beat Ireland 22-12 (halftime 6-9) in their international at Lansdowne Road on Saturday:</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Australia - Try: David Knox. Penalties: Matthew Burke (5). Conversion: Burke.</p>
<p>Ireland - Penalties: Paul Burke (4).</p>
</text>
